    {
      "title": "The Great Religious Reform and Covenant Renewal",
      "description": "Josiah gathered all the people and read the Book of the Law to them. He renewed the covenant with the Lord and carried out a comprehensive reform in which he removed all idolatry, destroyed the high places, and celebrated the greatest Passover since the days of the judges.",
