    {
      "title": "The Death of Josiah at Megiddo",
      "description": "Josiah went out to meet Pharaoh Neco of Egypt in battle at Megiddo, even though Neco warned him. Josiah was mortally wounded and died, and all Judah and Jerusalem mourned for him, including the prophet Jeremiah.",
